@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}
@phoneAuthToken = {{phone.response.body.$.data.phoneAuthToken}}
@phoneAuthCompleteToken = {{phoneVerify.response.body.$.data.phoneAuthCompleteToken}}
@passwordChangeToken = {{passwordToken.response.body.$.data.passwordChangeToken}}

### 시드: database/seed/mariadb_10_1/001_dev_sample_data.sql
### user 101 myultary.test@example.com / 01011112222 / Test1234!
### social GOOGLE google-myultary-test-001
### 아래 11a 로그인 또는 1c 시드 소셜 로그인 후 accessToken 사용

### 1a. 소셜 로그인 (Google · 신규 가입 포함) — FE/BFF가 OAuth 후 providerUserId 전달
# (= 1b와 동일 API) POST /api/v1/auth/social/login
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-test-user-001",
  "email": "google.user@example.com",
  "name": "구글유저"
}

### 1b. 소셜 로그인 (Kakao · 신규)
# (= 1a와 동일 API) POST /api/v1/auth/social/login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "providerUserId": "kakao-test-user-001",
  "email": "kakao.user@example.com"
}

### 1c. 소셜 로그인 (시드 user 101) — main/feed 등 requests와 동일
# @name socialLoginSeed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-myultary-test-001",
  "email": "myultary.test@example.com",
  "name": "한호"
}

### 2. Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3a. 닉네임 변경 가능 여부
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me/nickname/change-availability
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3b. 닉네임 변경 (생성·변경 후 7일 쿨다운)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "울타리닉"
}

### 3c. 회원정보 변경 (닉네임 제외 · 시드 지역)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "강아지랑 산책하는 집사",
  "regionSido": "서울특별시",
  "regionSigungu": "마포구"
}

### 4. Refresh
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. 소셜 계정 연동 (로그인 필요)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "providerUserId": "kakao-link-user-001",
  "email": "kakao.link@example.com"
}

### 6. 소셜 계정 연동 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/unlink?provider=KAKAO
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. 휴대폰 인증 요청
# @name phone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01012345679"
}

### 8. 휴대폰 인증 확인 (서버 로그의 code 확인)
# @name phoneVerify
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/phone/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneAuthToken": "{{phoneAuthToken}}",
  "code": "140248"
}

### 9. 닉네임 중복확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/nickname/check?nickname=폰가입유저

### 10. 회원가입 (휴대폰 + 비밀번호)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneAuthCompleteToken": "{{phoneAuthCompleteToken}}",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "nickname": "폰가입유저",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "email": "phone.user@ultary.local"
}

### 11a. 로그인 (email + password) — seed user_no=101
# (= 11b와 동일 API) POST /api/v1/auth/login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "myultary.test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 11b. 로그인 (phone + password) — seed · 숫자만
# (= 11a와 동일 API) POST /api/v1/auth/login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01011112222",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 11b-2. 로그인 (phone 하이픈) — 서버 정규화 후 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "010-1111-2222",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 12. 비밀번호 변경/설정 토큰 (비로그인 · 휴대폰 인증 완료 후)
# @name passwordToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01011112222",
  "phoneAuthCompleteToken": "{{phoneAuthCompleteToken}}"
}

### 13a. 비밀번호 변경/설정 (비로그인 · passwordChangeToken)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passwordChangeToken": "{{passwordChangeToken}}",
  "newPassword": "NewPass1234!"
}

### 13b. 비밀번호 변경/설정 (로그인 상태)
# 이미 비밀번호가 있으면 currentPassword 필수 / 소셜만 쓰면 currentPassword 생략 가능
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Test1234!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass1234!"
}

### 14. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. 회원탈퇴
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
